# Scored input: LJ + long-range Coulomb with PPPM. Verifier-owned.
#
# The direct sibling of the plain cut style: the same Lennard-Jones term with a
# real-space Coulomb term and a particle-particle particle-mesh mesh solve, on a
# charged simple melt. The mesh order is pinned with `kspace_modify` so neither
# configuration can win by using a cheaper mesh.
#
# The first 50 steps are warm-up; the compared window (the grader compares the
# first 25 printed timesteps) lies inside them and inside the timed run, so the
# compared window and the timed run are the same trajectory.

units           lj
atom_style      charge
newton          on

lattice         fcc 0.8442
region          box block 0 12 0 12 0 12
create_box      1 box
create_atoms    1 box
mass            1 1.0
set             group all charge 0.05

velocity        all create 1.0 87287 loop geom

pair_style      lj/cut/coul/long 2.5 2.5
pair_coeff      1 1 1.0 1.0 2.5

kspace_style    pppm 1.0e-4
kspace_modify   order 5

neighbor        0.3 bin
neigh_modify    delay 0 every 20 check no

fix             1 all nve
timestep        0.005
thermo          1
thermo_style    custom step temp pe ke etotal press

run             50
run             250
